Yes its amazing how easy it sneaks in! Was looking at a gist of mine recently (<a href="https://gist.github.com/1222875" rel="nofollow">https://gist.github.com/1222875</a>) and it suddenly jumped out at me!<p><pre><code>  my $hits = ...

  for my $hit (@$hits) {
      my $user = $hit->{_source};
      ...
  }
</code></pre>
:)
